<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's MEA ups capital by $31 mln.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's MEA ups capital by $31 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's Middle East Airlines MEA.CN (MEA) increased its capital on Friday by $31.25 million to $131.25 million, under a plan launched in July to rehabilitate the ailing airline.</p>
<p>The increase, approved at an extraordinary shareholders' meeting, is part of the plan to raise the airline's capital by $225 million.</p>
</text>
